============================== TABLE B -- paired comparisons (08_SPEC §2) ==============================
Only the pairs listed in 08_SPEC §2 are computed; all-pairs is not done (multiple-comparison problem).
Sign test is paired per block (same channel/noise realisation, 06_SPEC §2). 'a:b' = only-first-fails : only-second-fails.
POWER GUARD (R6/R7, pre-registered): >= 3 decision points AND >= 6 discordant pairs at >= 2 of them,
otherwise UNDECIDED is printed and no significance call is made.
The decision SNRs of a pair are anchored on its BASELINE member (exp_0925's pre-registered rule; never on one
of our arms, which would let our own arm choose where it is evaluated). The anchor arm is printed on every row.

